# Case of the Locked Hothouse. "To solve - You control seven or more lands" (CR 719.3a): Fastbond puts five Forests out on
# turn 1 (four damage), and with five lands, then six on turn 3, nothing triggers at Bot1's end step. With the seventh on
# turn 5 the Case becomes solved. On turn 7 "Solved - ... you may play lands and cast creature and enchantment spells from the
# top of your library" (CR 702.169b, 305.1, 601.3) works: the Forest on top is played from there, the Llanowar Elves under it
# cast, and then a second Fastbond, an enchantment; the Sol Ring under that, an artifact, is not offered though there is mana
# for it.

